{"candidateAnswer":"Late December 2022","evidence":"[D3:1 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: Hey Maria, great to chat again! I joined a service-focused online group last week and it's been an emotional ride. Everyone there is incredible with their own inspiring stories. They've opened my eyes to new perspectives, and I'm feeling a sense of connection and purpose with them.","itemId":"urn:uuid:8e7a1077-5398-54d1-8a9f-fa8bf8d9d28f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c363b24bc02d6c6bceb52d2fd6336a70263b94eb26f79b15486d37b3351a1479","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John join the online support group?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 1 January 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c363b24bc02d6c6bceb52d2fd6336a70263b94eb26f79b15486d37b3351a1479"}}]}